[{"id":"kharaja-55-22-0","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izlaze","en":"come out"},{"bs":"izašli su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izašli ste","en":"you (all) went out"}],"ref":"55:22","answerWord":"يَخْرُجُ","answerSound":"audio/e7914582f17b73344066.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"There cometh forth from both of them the pearl and coral-stone.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["يَخْرُجُ","مِنْهُمَا","ٱللُّؤْلُؤُ","وَٱلْمَرْجَانُ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-2-243-4","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izašli su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izašli ste","en":"you (all) went out"},{"bs":"izlazi","en":"he/it goes out"},{"bs":"pa izlazi!","en":"so get out!"}],"ref":"2:243","answerWord":"خَرَجُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/0ca97d8c8cde42491c89.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Bethink thee (O Muhammad) of those of old, who went forth from their habitations in their thousands, fearing death, and Allah said unto them: Die; and then He brought them back to life. Lo! Allah is a Lord of Kindness to mankind, but most of mankind give not thanks.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","خَرَجُوا۟","مِن","دِيَٰرِهِمْ","وَهُمْ","أُلُوفٌ","حَذَرَ","ٱلْمَوْتِ","فَقَالَ","لَهُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مُوتُوا۟","ثُمَّ","أَحْيَٰهُمْ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","لَذُو","فَضْلٍ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","وَلَٰكِنَّ","أَكْثَرَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","لَا","يَشْكُرُونَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-15-34-1","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa izlazi!","en":"so get out!"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"come out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izađite!","en":"(you all) go out!"}],"ref":"15:34","answerWord":"فَٱخْرُجْ","answerSound":"audio/3e6a3a8d43dd5cad5a16.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Then go thou forth from hence, for lo! thou art outcast.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["قَالَ","فَٱخْرُجْ","مِنْهَا","فَإِنَّكَ","رَجِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-28-21-0","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"pa je izašao","en":"so he went out"},{"bs":"izašle su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izlazi","en":"he/it goes out"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo izaći","en":"surely we will go out"}],"ref":"28:21","answerWord":"فَخَرَجَ","answerSound":"audio/7c5ddda1d47390771960.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"So he escaped from thence, fearing, vigilant. He said: My Lord! Deliver me from the wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["فَخَرَجَ","مِنْهَا","خَآئِفًا","يَتَرَقَّبُ","قَالَ","رَبِّ","نَجِّنِى","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-54-7-2","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"pa je izašao","en":"so he went out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izađi!","en":"go out!"}],"ref":"54:7","answerWord":"يَخْرُجُونَ","answerSound":"audio/9af84f35f0c045d13c23.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"With downcast eyes, they come forth from the graves as they were locusts spread abroad,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["خُشَّعًا","أَبْصَٰرُهُمْ","يَخْرُجُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْأَجْدَاثِ","كَأَنَّهُمْ","جَرَادٌ","مُّنتَشِرٌ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-2-149-2","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izašao si","en":"you went out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"come out"},{"bs":"izađi!","en":"go out!"}],"ref":"2:149","answerWord":"خَرَجْتَ","answerSound":"audio/4a9c72af148c421db016.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whencesoever thou comest forth (for prayer, O Muhammad) turn thy face toward the Inviolable Place of Worship. Lo! it is the Truth from thy Lord. Allah is not unaware of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["وَمِنْ","حَيْثُ","خَرَجْتَ","فَوَلِّ","وَجْهَكَ","شَطْرَ","ٱلْمَسْجِدِ","ٱلْحَرَامِ","وَإِنَّهُۥ","لَلْحَقُّ","مِن","رَّبِّكَ","وَمَا","ٱللَّهُ","بِغَٰفِلٍ","عَمَّا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-7-18-1","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izađi!","en":"go out!"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo izaći","en":"surely we will go out"}],"ref":"7:18","answerWord":"ٱخْرُجْ","answerSound":"audio/f0fddc77ac39a1acc7ef.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Go forth from hence, degraded, banished. As for such of them as follow thee, surely I will fill hell with all of you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["قَالَ","ٱخْرُجْ","مِنْهَا","مَذْءُومًا","مَّدْحُورًا","لَّمَن","تَبِعَكَ","مِنْهُمْ","لَأَمْلَأَنَّ","جَهَنَّمَ","مِنكُمْ","أَجْمَعِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-2-240-13","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izašle su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"pa izlazi!","en":"so get out!"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"}],"ref":"2:240","answerWord":"خَرَجْنَ","answerSound":"audio/b02bf19be146aedcc643.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(In the case of) those of you who are about to die and leave behind them wives, they should bequeath unto their wives a provision for the year without turning them out, but if they go out (of their own accord) there is no sin for you in that which they do of themselves within their rights. Allah is Mighty, Wise.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُتَوَفَّوْنَ","مِنكُمْ","وَيَذَرُونَ","أَزْوَٰجًا","وَصِيَّةً","لِّأَزْوَٰجِهِم","مَّتَٰعًا","إِلَى","ٱلْحَوْلِ","غَيْرَ","إِخْرَاجٍ","فَإِنْ","خَرَجْنَ","فَلَا","جُنَاحَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","فِى","مَا","فَعَلْنَ","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِنَّ","مِن","مَّعْرُوفٍ","وَٱللَّهُ","عَزِيزٌ","حَكِيمٌ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-4-66-8","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izađite!","en":"(you all) go out!"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"izlazi","en":"he/it goes out"},{"bs":"izašli ste","en":"you (all) went out"}],"ref":"4:66","answerWord":"ٱخْرُجُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/7ebdb8493ee5fdc8273c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We had decreed for them: Lay down your lives or go forth from your dwellings, but few of them would have done it; though if they did what they are exhorted to do it would be better for them, and more strengthening;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّا","كَتَبْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","أَنِ","ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","أَوِ","ٱخْرُجُوا۟","مِن","دِيَٰرِكُم","مَّا","فَعَلُوهُ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","وَلَوْ","أَنَّهُمْ","فَعَلُوا۟","مَا","يُوعَظُونَ","بِهِۦ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُمْ","وَأَشَدَّ","تَثْبِيتًا"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-9-83-10","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izašli su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"zaista ćemo izaći","en":"surely we will go out"}],"ref":"9:83","answerWord":"تَخْرُجُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/f07189f32f9bd7b9e7d4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"If Allah bring thee back (from the campaign) unto a party of them and they ask of thee leave to go out (to fight), then say unto them: Ye shall never more go out with me nor fight with me against a foe. Ye were content with sitting still the first time. So sit still, with the useless.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["فَإِن","رَّجَعَكَ","ٱللَّهُ","إِلَىٰ","طَآئِفَةٍ","مِّنْهُمْ","فَٱسْتَـْٔذَنُوكَ","لِلْخُرُوجِ","فَقُل","لَّن","تَخْرُجُوا۟","مَعِىَ","أَبَدًا","وَلَن","تُقَٰتِلُوا۟","مَعِىَ","عَدُوًّا","إِنَّكُمْ","رَضِيتُم","بِٱلْقُعُودِ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍ","فَٱقْعُدُوا۟","مَعَ","ٱلْخَٰلِفِينَ"],"marked":[10],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-24-53-6","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista će izaći","en":"surely they will go out"},{"bs":"pa izlazi!","en":"so get out!"},{"bs":"izašli su","en":"they went out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"}],"ref":"24:53","answerWord":"لَيَخْرُجُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/cb469d95b6b466c372c4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They swear by Allah solemnly that, if thou order them, they will go forth. Say: Swear not; known obedience (is better). Lo! Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","بِٱللَّهِ","جَهْدَ","أَيْمَٰنِهِمْ","لَئِنْ","أَمَرْتَهُمْ","لَيَخْرُجُنَّ","قُل","لَّا","تُقْسِمُوا۟","طَاعَةٌ","مَّعْرُوفَةٌ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","خَبِيرٌۢ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-30-25-15","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izašli ste","en":"you (all) went out"},{"bs":"izašao si","en":"you went out"},{"bs":"izađi!","en":"go out!"}],"ref":"30:25","answerWord":"تَخْرُجُونَ","answerSound":"audio/67e302b9e4909477dba3.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And of His signs is this: The heavens and the earth stand fast by His command, and afterward, when He calleth you, lo! from the earth ye will emerge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["وَمِنْ","ءَايَٰتِهِۦٓ","أَن","تَقُومَ","ٱلسَّمَآءُ","وَٱلْأَرْضُ","بِأَمْرِهِۦ","ثُمَّ","إِذَا","دَعَاكُمْ","دَعْوَةً","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","إِذَآ","أَنتُمْ","تَخْرُجُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"kharaja-59-11-14","words":["verb:kharaja"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista ćemo izaći","en":"surely we will go out"},{"bs":"izlazite","en":"you (all) go out"},{"bs":"izlaze","en":"they go out"},{"bs":"izađi!","en":"go out!"}],"ref":"59:11","answerWord":"لَنَخْرُجَنَّ","answerSound":"audio/305e37d25f16b89f426a.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Hast thou not observed those who are hypocrites, (how) they tell their brethren who disbelieve among the People of the Scripture: If ye are driven out, we surely will go out with you, and we will never obey anyone against you, and if ye are attacked we verily will help you. And Allah beareth witness that they verily are liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"izaći","en":"to go out, to leave"},"passage":["أَلَمْ","تَرَ","إِلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","نَافَقُوا۟","يَقُولُونَ","لِإِخْوَٰنِهِمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","مِنْ","أَهْلِ","ٱلْكِتَٰبِ","لَئِنْ","أُخْرِجْتُمْ","لَنَخْرُجَنَّ","مَعَكُمْ","وَلَا","نُطِيعُ","فِيكُمْ","أَحَدًا","أَبَدًا","وَإِن","قُوتِلْتُمْ","لَنَنصُرَنَّكُمْ","وَٱللَّهُ","يَشْهَدُ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"خَرَجَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-26-66-1","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potopili smo","en":"We drowned"},{"bs":"potopili smo ih","en":"we drowned them"},{"bs":"potopimo ih","en":"We drown them"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"}],"ref":"26:66","answerWord":"أَغْرَقْنَا","answerSound":"audio/4e783e08c8cb8251b418.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We drowned the others.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["ثُمَّ","أَغْرَقْنَا","ٱلْءَاخَرِينَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-7-136-2","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ih potopili","en":"so we drowned them"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"},{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"},{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"}],"ref":"7:136","answerWord":"فَأَغْرَقْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/bd1759a5632926771aec.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Therefore We took retribution from them; therefore We drowned them in the sea: because they denied Our revelations and were heedless of them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["فَٱنتَقَمْنَا","مِنْهُمْ","فَأَغْرَقْنَٰهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْيَمِّ","بِأَنَّهُمْ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَا","وَكَانُوا۟","عَنْهَا","غَٰفِلِينَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-2-50-5","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"},{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"},{"bs":"pa vas potapa","en":"so he/it drowns you (all)"}],"ref":"2:50","answerWord":"وَأَغْرَقْنَآ","answerSound":"audio/425deab28da1fe5fff2d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when We brought you through the sea and rescued you, and drowned the folk of Pharaoh in your sight.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","فَرَقْنَا","بِكُمُ","ٱلْبَحْرَ","فَأَنجَيْنَٰكُمْ","وَأَغْرَقْنَآ","ءَالَ","فِرْعَوْنَ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَنظُرُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-7-64-6","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"},{"bs":"pa smo ih potopili","en":"so we drowned them"},{"bs":"pa vas potapa","en":"so he/it drowns you (all)"},{"bs":"potopimo ih","en":"We drown them"}],"ref":"7:64","answerWord":"وَأَغْرَقْنَا","answerSound":"audio/e2757dbbab1716552913.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But they denied him, so We saved him and those with him in the ship, and We drowned those who denied Our tokens. Lo! they were blind folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["فَكَذَّبُوهُ","فَأَنجَيْنَٰهُ","وَٱلَّذِينَ","مَعَهُۥ","فِى","ٱلْفُلْكِ","وَأَغْرَقْنَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِنَآ","إِنَّهُمْ","كَانُوا۟","قَوْمًا","عَمِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-17-69-12","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa vas potapa","en":"so he/it drowns you (all)"},{"bs":"potopili smo ih","en":"we drowned them"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"},{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"}],"ref":"17:69","answerWord":"فَيُغْرِقَكُم","answerSound":"audio/218fe89f8c2dbe970e87.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Or feel ye secure that He will not return you to that (plight) a second time, and send against you a hurricane of wind and drown you for your thanklessness, and then ye will not find therein that ye have any avenger against Us?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["أَمْ","أَمِنتُمْ","أَن","يُعِيدَكُمْ","فِيهِ","تَارَةً","أُخْرَىٰ","فَيُرْسِلَ","عَلَيْكُمْ","قَاصِفًا","مِّنَ","ٱلرِّيحِ","فَيُغْرِقَكُم","بِمَا","كَفَرْتُمْ","ثُمَّ","لَا","تَجِدُوا۟","لَكُمْ","عَلَيْنَا","بِهِۦ","تَبِيعًا"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-17-103-5","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"},{"bs":"potopili smo","en":"We drowned"},{"bs":"potopili smo ih","en":"we drowned them"},{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"}],"ref":"17:103","answerWord":"فَأَغْرَقْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/b1b7c46e9b4a8ffdfd74.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And he wished to scare them from the land, but We drowned him and those with him, all together.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["فَأَرَادَ","أَن","يَسْتَفِزَّهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","فَأَغْرَقْنَٰهُ","وَمَن","مَّعَهُۥ","جَمِيعًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-25-37-5","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potopili smo ih","en":"we drowned them"},{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"},{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"}],"ref":"25:37","answerWord":"أَغْرَقْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/270f6e4fb66692f44a34.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And Noah's folk, when they denied the messengers, We drowned them and made of them a portent for mankind. We have prepared a painful doom for evil-doers.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["وَقَوْمَ","نُوحٍ","لَّمَّا","كَذَّبُوا۟","ٱلرُّسُلَ","أَغْرَقْنَٰهُمْ","وَجَعَلْنَٰهُمْ","لِلنَّاسِ","ءَايَةً","وَأَعْتَدْنَا","لِلظَّٰلِمِينَ","عَذَابًا","أَلِيمًا"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-36-43-2","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potopimo ih","en":"We drown them"},{"bs":"pa smo ih potopili","en":"so we drowned them"},{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"}],"ref":"36:43","answerWord":"نُغْرِقْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/ce08d414490d3769a48e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We will, We drown them, and there is no help for them, neither can they be saved;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["وَإِن","نَّشَأْ","نُغْرِقْهُمْ","فَلَا","صَرِيخَ","لَهُمْ","وَلَا","هُمْ","يُنقَذُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}},{"id":"aghraqa-71-25-2","words":["verb:aghraqa"],"options":[{"bs":"potopljeni su","en":"they were drowned"},{"bs":"pa smo ga potopili","en":"so we drowned him"},{"bs":"potopili smo ih","en":"we drowned them"},{"bs":"i potopili smo","en":"and we drowned"}],"ref":"71:25","answerWord":"أُغْرِقُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/b0bd67fff8c7ec7baa2d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Because of their sins they were drowned, then made to enter a Fire. And they found they had no helpers in place of Allah.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"potopiti","en":"to drown"},"passage":["مِّمَّا","خَطِيٓـَٰٔتِهِمْ","أُغْرِقُوا۟","فَأُدْخِلُوا۟","نَارًا","فَلَمْ","يَجِدُوا۟","لَهُم","مِّن","دُونِ","ٱللَّهِ","أَنصَارًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَغْرَقَ"}}]